      "updated": 1785961466481,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The Gouraud shading is evaluated ONCE PER VERTEX.\nIt interpolates the intensity.\nIts implementation in GLSL would look like this:",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "The Gouraud shading is evaluated ONCE PER VERTEX.\nIt interpolates the intensity.\nIts implementation in GLSL would look like this:",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "uVg896HBvPOLDFOeX-o0P",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 125.03954986108494,
      "y": 1218.7873051503586,
      "width": 549.999267578125,
      "height": 150,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#f08c00",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
